"Track per-app network usage" = "跟踪单个应用的网络使用情况";
"Attribute network traffic to individual apps, so the Analytics tab and the network menu can show which apps are using the network. It samples the system's \u{201C}nettop\u{201D} tool briefly each refresh; the overall download and upload rates are always shown regardless." = "将网络流量归因到各个应用,以便分析标签页和网络菜单显示哪些应用正在使用网络。每次刷新时会简要对系统的“nettop”工具采样;无论如何总会显示总下载和上传速率。";
"High-resolution logging" = "高分辨率记录";
"Standard-resolution logging" = "标准分辨率记录";
"Every process is logged at this resolution for the most recent window. Finer and longer means more detail, and a larger database. At 1 s the per-process scan also runs every second even with the window closed, which is the app's main idle CPU cost; 2 s or slower is noticeably lighter." = "在最近的时间窗口内按此分辨率记录每个进程。更精细且时间更长意味着更多细节和更大的数据库。在 1 秒时,即使窗口关闭,按进程的扫描也会每秒运行一次,这是应用空闲时的主要 CPU 开销;2 秒或更慢则明显更轻量。";
"Older data is aggregated to this coarser resolution. Its age is additive: detailed history spans the high-resolution age plus this (e.g. 24h + 7d = 8 days), with about 90 days of hourly history kept beneath it." = "较旧的数据会聚合到这种较粗的分辨率。其时长是累加的:详细历史记录涵盖高分辨率时长加上此时长(例如 24 小时 + 7 天 = 8 天),其下方保留约 90 天的按小时历史记录。";
"When the database reaches this size, the oldest high-resolution samples are dropped first, keeping the long low-resolution trend." = "当数据库达到此大小时,最旧的高分辨率样本将首先被丢弃,保留长期的低分辨率趋势。";
"These settings need about %@, more than your %@ size limit. The oldest high-resolution samples will be dropped early to fit: raise the size limit or reduce resolution to keep it all." = "这些设置需要约 %@,超过了您的 %@ 大小上限。最旧的高分辨率样本将被提前丢弃以适应上限 , 提高大小上限或降低分辨率以保留全部。";
"You're near the %@-sample limit above which the app slows down, so retention is capped at what fits. To keep more history, choose a coarser frequency." = "您已接近 %@ 个样本的上限,超过此上限应用会变慢,因此保留时间受限于所能容纳的量。若要保留更多历史记录,请选择较粗的频率。";
