"Also show %@ in the Dock while it's running, as a second way to open it: handy if your menu bar is too crowded to see the menu bar items. It still runs from the menu bar either way." = "运行时也在程序坞中显示 %@,作为打开它的第二种方式。如果您的菜单栏过于拥挤而看不到菜单栏项目,这会很方便。无论哪种方式,它仍然从菜单栏运行。";
"All alerts are off by default except critical pressure and runaway processes. %@ never sends anything off your Mac." = "除严重压力和失控进程外,所有提醒默认关闭。%@ 绝不会向您的 Mac 之外发送任何数据。";
"Focus shows one chosen read-out in the smallest practical space." = "聚焦模式在尽可能小的空间内显示一个选定的读数。";
