"Set up access" = "设置访问权限";
"Both are optional and can be changed later in Settings." = "两者都是可选的,之后可在设置中更改。";
"Start in the menu bar and keep history unbroken from the moment you sign in." = "从菜单栏启动,并在您登录后保持历史记录不间断。";
"Approve the helper in System Settings to finish enabling it." = "在系统设置中批准该辅助程序以完成启用。";
