/* ===== Metric Cards & Explanations ===== */

"Free" = "可用内存";
"App" = "App 内存";
"Wired" = "联动内存";
"Compressed" = "被压缩内存";
"Cached files" = "缓存文件";
"What it means" = "指标含义";
"How it's calculated" = "计算方式";
"macOS's own read on how hard the memory system is working, on a 0 to 100 scale. 0 to 33 is green and comfortable, 34 to 66 is yellow as it compresses and caches to cope, and 67 to 100 is red, where it swaps to disk and apps can slow down. It is the single number to watch." = "macOS 自行评估的内存系统负载压力，范围为 0 到 100。0 到 33 为绿色舒适状态；34 到 66 为黄色，表示系统正在通过压缩和缓存来应对；67 到 100 为红色，表示正在向磁盘交换数据且应用可能会变慢。这是最核心需要关注的指标。";
"The colour band comes from the kernel's memory-pressure level. Within that band the exact position is set by how loaded memory is: 50 percent from compression (compressed memory over RAM, full at half your RAM), 30 percent from swap (swap over RAM, full at one times your RAM), and 20 percent from how fast compressed plus swap is rising. The value is the band floor plus that signal times 33." = "颜色区间来自内核的内存压力级别。在对应区间内，具体数值由内存负载程度决定：50% 来自压缩（压缩内存占 RAM 的比例，在达到 RAM 一半时满格），30% 来自交换（交换空间占 RAM 的比例，在达到 RAM 1 倍时满格），20% 来自压缩加交换的上升速度。最终数值为区间底值加上该信号乘 33。";
"RAM that is not currently held by the four categories below, so it is immediately available for new work. macOS deliberately keeps this low by using spare RAM as a file cache, so a small free figure is normal and healthy, not a problem." = "未被以下四类占用的 RAM，可立即可供新任务使用。macOS 会通过将闲置 RAM 用作文件缓存来刻意保持较低的空闲值，因此空闲数值较小是完全正常且健康的，并非问题。";
"Your total installed RAM minus the four measured categories: free = total minus wired, app, compressed and cached files, never below zero. Derived this way so the parts always reconcile to your installed RAM exactly. This is the same as the dashboard's 'Free and available' slice." = "总安装 RAM 减去已测量的四类内存：空闲 = 总量减去联动、App、被压缩及缓存文件，且不低于零。以此方式计算可确保各部分之和与安装的 RAM 完全一致。这与仪表盘中的“空闲与可用”切片相同。";
"Memory that apps are actively using and that is not a reclaimable file cache. It is the closest match to Activity Monitor's 'App Memory'." = "应用程序正在活跃使用的内存，不包括可回收的文件缓存。这与活动监视器中的“App 内存”最为接近。";
"Anonymous, app-allocated memory minus the part the system can drop on demand: app = max(internal minus purgeable, 0), read from the kernel's VM statistics and multiplied by the page size." = "匿名且由 App 分配的内存减去系统可按需丢弃的部分：App = max(内部减去可清除, 0)，从内核的 VM 统计信息中读取并乘以页面大小。";
"Memory the compressor has squeezed so more fits in RAM without going to disk. A little is normal; a lot, and rising, is an early sign of pressure." = "压缩器为了在 RAM 中容纳更多数据而进行压缩的内存，避免写入磁盘。少量压缩属于正常现象；大量且持续上升则是内存压力的早期信号。";
"The compressor's page count times the page size: compressed = compressor page count times page size, read from the kernel's VM statistics." = "压缩器的页面计数乘以页面大小：被压缩 = 压缩器页面计数乘以页面大小，从内核的 VM 统计信息中读取。";
"Spare RAM that macOS is using to keep recently used files handy. This is not a problem: it is released the instant anything needs the space, so it should never be a cause for concern." = "用作良性文件缓存的闲置 RAM，在需要时立即可释放。这不会造成问题：一旦有任何程序需要空间就会立即释放，因此无需担心。";
"File-backed pages plus purgeable pages, times the page size: cached = (external plus purgeable) times page size, from the kernel's VM statistics." = "文件支持的页面加上可清除页面，乘以页面大小：缓存 = (外部加上可清除) 乘以页面大小，来自内核的 VM 统计信息。";
"Data the system has moved out to disk because RAM filled up. It is distinct from compression. A flat line at zero is ideal; a sustained climb under pressure is the real warning sign." = "因为 RAM 装满而由系统移到磁盘的数据。它与压缩有所不同。零位置的水平线是理想状态；压力下的持续上升才是真正的危险信号。";
"Taken straight from the kernel's swap usage figure (vm.swapusage.xsu_used). Swap lives on disk, not in RAM, so it is shown on its own and is not part of the total-RAM split." = "直接取自内核的交换使用量数值 (vm.swapusage.xsu_used)。交换内存位于磁盘而非 RAM 中，因此独立显示，不属于总 RAM 划分的一部分。";
"How much of your Mac's total CPU capacity is in use right now, across all cores, from 0 to 100 percent. 100 percent means every logical core is fully busy." = "当前所有核心上使用的 Mac 总 CPU 容量比例，从 0 到 100 百分比。100% 意味着每个逻辑核心都处于完全繁忙状态。";
"The busy fraction of each logical core (user plus system time over the tick, from the kernel's per-core tick counters) averaged across all cores, times 100. The split below is that same total divided into user-mode and system-mode (kernel) time." = "每个逻辑核心的繁忙比例（采样间隔内的用户加系统时间，来自内核的每核心时钟滴答计数器）在所有核心上的平均值，乘以 100。下方的拆分是将该总计分为用户模式和系统模式（内核）时间。";
"The run-queue length (roughly how many processes are competing to run) averaged over the last minute, with the 5 and 15-minute figures beside it. A load near your core count (%@) means the CPU is fully subscribed; well above it means work is queuing." = "运行队列长度（大致代表有多少进程在竞争运行），在过去 1 分钟内的平均值，旁边附带 5 分钟和 15 分钟的数值。接近核心数的负载 (%@) 意味着 CPU 已被充分利用；远高于核心数则意味着任务正在排队。";
"Read straight from the kernel's load averages (the same numbers `uptime` reports). The bar shows the 1-minute load relative to your logical core count, full at one process per core." = "直接从内核的平均负载中读取（与 uptime 命令报告的数值相同）。柱状条显示相对于逻辑核心数的 1 分钟负载，每个核心对应一个进程时为满格。";
"CPU now" = "当前 CPU";
"CPU split" = "CPU 模式拆分";
"Lifetime max" = "历史最大占用";
"Started" = "启动时间";
"Age" = "运行时长";
"Coverage" = "读取覆盖度";
"Direct user read" = "直接用户权限读取";
"Footprint not readable at user level" = "用户级别无法读取占用";
"This process has exited. Showing its last logged history." = "此进程已退出。显示其最后记录的历史数据。";
"%@ of one core · %@ of total" = "%@ (单核心) · %@ (总容量)";
"%d%% user / %d%% system (lifetime)" = "%d%% 用户态 / %d%% 系统态 (历史累计)";
"launchd (system launcher)" = "launchd (系统启动器)";
"The first process macOS starts (PID 1). It launches and supervises every other service and app. Essential: never quit it." = "macOS 启动的首个进程 (PID 1)。负责启动并监管所有其他服务和应用。系统核心组件：切勿退出。";
"Window Server" = "窗口服务器 (Window Server)";
"Draws and composites everything you see on screen. Higher CPU/RAM is normal with many windows, multiple or high-resolution displays, and animations." = "负责绘制并合成屏幕上显示的所有内容。当打开大量窗口、使用多台/高分辨率显示器或有动画运行时，CPU 和内存占用偏高属于正常现象。";
"Kernel" = "内核 (Kernel)";
"The core of macOS itself. It also deliberately uses CPU to keep the Mac cool: so high CPU here often means the system is managing heat, not a problem you can fix by quitting it." = "macOS 系统的核心本身。它还会通过调度 CPU 运转来协助散热：因此此处 CPU 偏高通常表明系统正在进行散热管理，而非程序故障。";
"%d processes" = "%d 个进程";
"%d not readable" = "%d 个无法读取";
"The hottest of the CPU die's temperature sensors, the figure people mean by \u{201C}CPU temperature\u{201D}. High numbers under load are normal on Apple silicon; the colour turns orange or red only when macOS itself reports thermal pressure, the signal that it is slowing work down." = "CPU 芯片上最热的温度传感器，也就是大家通常所说的“CPU 温度”。Apple 芯片在高负载下出现较高数值属正常现象；只有当 macOS 自身报告散热压力（即系统正在降频的信号）时，颜色才会变为橙色或红色。";
"Every P-core and E-core cluster sensor the SMC exposes is read on a short throttle, and the card shows the maximum. The trend behind it is the same two-hour window as the other header cards." = "SMC 暴露的每个性能核 (P-core) 和能效核 (E-core) 传感器都在较短的时间间隔内被读取，卡片显示其中的最大值。其背后的趋势曲线与其他卡片相同，展示 2 小时的时间窗口。";
"The share of each interval the GPU spent executing work, from the graphics driver's own device utilisation counter. It is the same figure Activity Monitor's GPU History shows." = "GPU 在每个采样间隔内执行工作的时间比例，来自图形驱动程序自身的设备利用率计数器。这与活动监视器的 GPU 历史记录中显示的数值相同。";
"IOAccelerator `Device Utilization %`, read from the IORegistry once a second; the sparkline is the value over the selected range." = "IOAccelerator 中的“Device Utilization %”，每秒从 IORegistry 读取一次；火花线显示所选时间范围内的数值。";
"How much power the GPU block is drawing. On Apple silicon the GPU shares the chip's power budget with the CPU, so a busy GPU can throttle everything." = "GPU 模块当前消耗的功率。在 Apple 芯片上，GPU 与 CPU 共享整颗芯片的功耗预算，因此繁忙的 GPU 可能会限制整体性能。";
"The chip's GPU energy counter (IOReport `Energy Model`, the source powermetrics uses) differenced between ticks and divided by the elapsed time." = "芯片的 GPU 能量计数器（IOReport 中的“Energy Model”，也是 powermetrics 工具使用的数据源）在时钟滴答之间的差值除以经过的时间。";
"Power drawn by the Apple Neural Engine, the block Core ML runs models on. It reads zero when idle, so any reading means an on-device model is executing. Its work is proxied through a system daemon, so it cannot be attributed to a single process." = "Apple 神经网络引擎 (ANE) 消耗的功率，Core ML 模型即在其上运行。空闲时读数为零，因此任何读数都意味着设备端模型正在执行。由于其任务是通过系统守护进程代理的，因此无法归因于单个进程。";
"The chip's ANE energy counter (IOReport `Energy Model`) differenced between ticks." = "时钟滴答之间芯片 ANE 能量计数器 (IOReport 中的“Energy Model”) 的差值。";
"How much of the unified memory is currently in use by GPU clients: textures, buffers, and, for AI runtimes, the model weights. It counts against the same RAM the CPU uses." = "当前被 GPU 客户端占用的统一内存大小：包括纹理、缓冲区以及 AI 运行时的模型权重。它会占用与 CPU 相同的 RAM 空间。";
"IOAccelerator `In use system memory`; the allocated figure in the Device panel is the larger amount reserved to GPU clients including cached allocations." = "IOAccelerator 中的“In use system memory”；设备面板中的已分配数值是为 GPU 客户端保留的更大空间，包含已缓存的分配。";
"How much of the interval the GPU was powered on at all. The difference between this and utilisation is time the GPU was awake but waiting; the Device panel shows which clock states it ran in." = "GPU 处于通电状态的采样间隔时间比例。该值与利用率之间的差值代表 GPU 处于清醒但处于等待状态的时间；设备面板显示了其运行的时钟状态。";
"100 minus the residency of the OFF state in IOReport's GPU performance-state channel." = "100 减去 IOReport 的 GPU 性能状态通道中关闭 (OFF) 状态的驻留比例。";
